o Programmable Logic Controls\nor EMET 230 Computerized I/O Systems\nIET 101Manufacturing Materials, Processes, and Laboratory\nMET 111Mechanics for Technology: Statics\nMATH 83Technical Calculus\nor MATH 140 Calculus With Analytic Geometry I\nPHYS 151Technical Physics II\nor PHYS 212 General Physics: Electricity and Magnetism\nor PHYS 251 Introductory Physics II\nor CHEM 110& CHEM 111 Chemical Principles I and Experimental Chemistry I\nSTS 200Critical Issues in Science, Technology, and Society\nor STS/PHIL 233 Ethics and the Design of Technology\nor STS 245\n"
